Source landscape: the 2023 Tinubu/Nigeria Chapter 1B documentary universe is sparse on direct nuclear-weapons material and concentrated instead in adjacent safety, nonproliferation, counterterrorism, biosecurity, cyber, and crisis-de-escalation records. The strongest candidate families are official Nigerian nuclear-regulatory and security documents, UNODA/IAEA 1540 and nuclear-security material, ECOWAS/Niger crisis records, and a smaller set of reputable local news and legal reference documents. Search saturation has not been reached; more source families still exist around procurement, legislative oversight, and archived treaty/institution records.

